    "title": "Meet Your Neighbor: Elizabeth Koldyke Boolbol - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago Delray Beach seasonal resident Elizabeth Koldyke Boolbol, pictured with Stella, is the founder of Partnership to End Human Trafficking, which seeks to help women recover from the trauma of human trafficking. She established the organization in 2016 in the Northeast and is working to expand its programs to South Florida. Tim Stepien/The Coastal Star. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
